  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin de la Aduana en Puerto Corts</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Puerto Corts Customs Modernization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es fortalecer la Aduana de Puerto Corts para que brinde servicios de calidad y bajo costo para el operador, garantice el control y la seguridad, alinendola con el esfuerzo del gobierno para lograr que Puerto Corts sea un hub logstico regional competitivo. Son objetivos especficos: (i) fortalecer la capacidad de control y seguridad de la aduana para que Puerto Corts pueda mantener su estatus de reconocimiento internacional como puerto seguro; (ii) mejorar la coordinacin operativa para reducir costos logsticos; y (iii) mejorar la infraestructura y el equipamiento para garantizar una atencin al usuario permanente y de calidad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s objective is to align the office of Puerto Cortes and the effort made by the Government to constitute the port in regional logistics hub, offering services in customs operations of high quality and low cost for the administration and foreign trade operator ensuring proper control and quasi-fiscal and security and thereby supporting the improvement in competitiveness. Specific project objectives are: (i) strengthening technical and operational coordination of customs in Puerto Cortes, (ii) provision of infrastructure and operating equipment, as well as the massive use of technology aimed at improving control and facilitation of operations.</narrative>
  </description>
